    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1004">

                <pb facs="1125" n="1029" xml:id="pg1029"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 132.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your telegram in cipher, which I translate as follows: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">January 28, 1898.</hi></p>
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodford</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Minister, Madrid:</hi></p>
                        <p>This Government appreciates the courtesy intended in the visit of Spanish
                            ships to United States ports.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I have officially informed the Spanish minister of foreign affairs of the receipt
                    of the above telegram, and have the honor to be,</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stewart L. Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
